    <section class="references" id="sect-00014">
    <title>References</title>
    <para id="para-00046">Bernstein, D. A., Clarke-stewart, A., &amp; Roy, E. J. (2008). Psychology. USA: Houghton Mifflin.</para>
    <para id="para-00047">Blazhenkova, O., &amp; Kozhevnikov, M. (2010). Visual-object ability: A new dimension of non-verbal intelligence. Cognition, 117(3), 276-301.</para>
