    <para id="para-00071">Wong, B. I., Yin, S., Yang, L., Li, J., &amp; Spaniol, J. (2018). Cultural differences in memory for objects and backgrounds in pictures. Journal of Cross-Cultural Psychology, 49(3), 404-417.</para>
